-SH.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3A53C28131D28D","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2004-FNP-SH","value":"semi-honest client and server (§3.2, p. 4; §4.3, pp. 8-9)"},{"dimension":"capability_tag","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2017-RR-CCS-EC-ROM.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3A6967282C7EA1","review_status":"scheme_declared","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2017-RR-CCS-EC-ROM","value":"exact-sender-set-size"},{"dimension":"setup","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-GPRTY-MAL-STAR.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3AB7D09CCBC900","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-GPRTY-MAL-STAR","value":"OOS OT extension with codewords of 627, 616, and 605 bits and \\( H_2 \\) outputs of 256 bits for \\( n = 2^{12}, 2^{16}, 2^{20} \\) (Figure 4, p. 23); star architecture with \\( q = 10 \\) leaves for \\( n = 2^{16} \\) and \\( q = 160 \\) for \\( n = 2^{20} \\), leaves of \\( 1.3n' + \\lambda + 0.5 \\log n' \\) positions, OKVS failure probability \\( 2^{-52.9} \\) and \\( 2^{-45.05} \\) from an empirically measured leaf failure rate of \\( 2^{-29.355} \\) (§5.4, pp. 17-18)"},{"dimension":"output_recipients","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2018-PSWW-2D.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3B15FA732EEBAF","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2018-PSWW-2D","value":"both parties agree on a symmetric function f and a circuit for it and compute \\( f(X \\cap Y) \\) (§2, p. 5); the measured instance outputs whether the intersection size exceeds a threshold (PSI-CAT) (§6.3, p. 24)"},{"dimension":"technique","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2018-PSWW-2D.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3B6CE3505AADD4","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2018-PSWW-2D","value":"permutation_based_hashing"},{"