ous random-oracle proof (Theorem 4, p. 10)"},{"dimension":"technique","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2020-ION-DDH.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3D25E3BED8F603","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2020-ION-DDH","value":"diffie_hellman"},{"dimension":"capability_tag","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-GS-AHE.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3DB036B7279367","review_status":"scheme_declared","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-GS-AHE","value":"sublinear-in-set-size"},{"dimension":"output","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2023-GS-TWO-PARTY.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3DE056DA41660B","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2023-GS-TWO-PARTY","value":"threshold"},{"dimension":"set_size_regime","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2017-RR-CCS-SM.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3DE9A56ED67E59","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2017-RR-CCS-SM","value":"balanced"},{"dimension":"output_recipients","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2004-FNP-CARDINALITY.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3E35E4DA273662","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2004-FNP-CARDINALITY","value":"the client only (§3.1, p. 3; §4.4, p. 9)"},{"dimension":"output","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-KRSSW-NR.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3E9351CDB38B45","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-KRSSW-NR","value":"intersection"},{"dimension":"capability_tag","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-RT-SH-V2.md","id":"PSI-PROP-3EA2F2C50A052E","review_status":"scheme_declared","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-RT-SH-V2","value":"no-ideal-permutation"},{"dim