":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2017-RR-CCS-DE-ROM","value":"F_encode realized by the Orrù-Orsini-Scholl 1-out-of-N OT extension with a BCH-(511, 76, 171) code, proven in the programmable random oracle model (§4, p. 6; §7, p. 18); hash function agreed by coin tossing (Figure 4, step 1, p. 12); items first hashed to 128 bits, then phased (§7, p. 18)"},{"dimension":"security_model","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2022-RR-MAL.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5901D8B0D3940A","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2022-RR-MAL","value":"random_oracle_model"},{"dimension":"output_recipients","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2016-KKRT.md","id":"PSI-PROP-596A3D65AB9B7E","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2016-KKRT","value":"both parties: Bob sends the intersection to Alice (Figure 3, step 6, p. 13)"},{"dimension":"technique","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-PSTY-BASIC.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5A0E815076E37A","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-PSTY-BASIC","value":"gmw"},{"dimension":"set_size_regime","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2012-HEK-SCS-WN.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5A652776513917","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2012-HEK-SCS-WN","value":"balanced"},{"dimension":"setup","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-NTY-NO-COLLUSION.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5A886B38DFD8FE","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-NTY-NO-COLLUSION","value":"Theorem 3.4 is in the \\( F_{\\mathrm{psi}}^{2,1,m} \\)-hybrid model (p. 8); the malicious variant hashes items with a random oracle (Protocol 3.3, note a, p. 8); the two-party PSI is instantiated with the server-aided PSI of Kamara et al., whose server is another party assumed not to collude (§3.1.1, p. 6; §3.2.2, p. 8; Appendix A, pp. 13-14); no oblivious transfer is used (§1.2, p. 4)"},{"dimension":"technique","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-GS-AHE.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5AECD984728A73","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2019-GS-AHE","value":"ole"},{"dimension":"security_model","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2004-FNP-MAL-SERVER.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5B17B095533E04","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2004-FNP-MAL-SERVER","value":"random_oracle_model"},{"dimension":"parties","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-BMRR-AHE-TWO-PARTY.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5B9B394FA99B86","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-BMRR-AHE-TWO-PARTY","value":"two_party"},{"dimension":"security_model","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-GPRTY-VOLE.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5BF91A805E479E","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-GPRTY-VOLE","value":"random_oracle_model"},{"dimension":"parties","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2022-RR-FAST.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5C408E92A876EC","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2022-RR-FAST","value":"two_party"},{"dimension":"set_size_regime","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-RS-CIRCUIT.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5CB45AA3398490","review_status":"fulltext_checked","scope":"construction","subject_id":"PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2021-RS-CIRCUIT","value":"balanced"},{"dimension":"parties","evidence_ref":"knowledge/primitives/psi/schemes/PSI-CONSTRUCTION-2023-GS-TWO-PARTY.md","id":"PSI-PROP-5CD9F59AAC7400","review_stat